5,1,1,talk,Servas,,"It is a pleasure to be with you all. Let us approach this selection with wisdom and a spirit of generosity. To begin, I shall examine the outcomes of the last three internal rollouts and the record of cross-unit standardization efforts.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,Um... hello. I think it would be a good idea to check the capital budget and software allowance... and maybe the vendor licence pricing versus fixed-fee work. I just want to make sure we can actually afford it.,"{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"Hi everyone! I'm so excited to be here! I want to find out what's really happening on the ground, so I'll look into the network coverage at customer plants and the in-house developer availability! Yay!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"I believe we must look beyond the surface of these proposals. To understand the actual friction in our operations, I will examine the misrouted deliveries in the incident logs and the time lost to copying existing records.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I believe we must account for the actual human cost of these projects. I will examine the staffing of the coordination group and the handling of vendor queries to see how the workload is managed.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Servas,,"It is heartening to see such a diverse range of interests. By blending our focus on historical outcomes with your practical concerns, we shall surely find a path that serves the company well.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I agree. I hope that by looking at the budget and the pricing, I can help us avoid any mistakes. I'll just do my best to find the right information.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Daisuke, don't be so nervous! You're doing great! I bet the numbers will tell us a super interesting story. I can't wait to see if the developers are ready for a big adventure!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Sakura, enthusiasm is useful, but data is more reliable. I am less interested in stories and more interested in the quantifiable losses we incur daily. That is where the true need for innovation lies.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Ryuji, I agree that quantifiable data is essential. However, the most significant losses often occur in the gaps where staff are overextended. We must ensure that ""innovation"" does not simply mean shifting a burden onto an exhausted team.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Servas,,Wisdom teaches us that the strength of a bridge is found not only in its materials but in the harmony of its design. Let us listen to one another with open hearts as we uncover these truths.,"{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think you're all right. I'll just stay quiet and focus on the budget records. I hope the information I find is actually useful to everyone.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Asuka, that's a really good point! We can't have everyone getting too tired, or they won't have any energy for fun stuff! I'll make sure to see if the developers are feeling super happy and ready!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Sakura, happiness is not a metric for project success. I am looking for systemic inefficiencies. If we ignore the actual errors occurring on the floor, we risk funding a solution for a problem that does not exist.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Ryuji, systemic inefficiencies are often the direct result of understaffing. If we ignore the human capacity to execute these plans, we are merely funding a theoretical solution that will fail in practice.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Servas,,"It is a joy to witness such a passionate exchange. Let us now move forward with our investigations, trusting that the truth we uncover will guide us toward a choice that honors both our goals and our people.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I... I'll go look into the records now. I hope I can find something that helps us make a safe decision. I'll see you all later.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
22,1,4,pass,Daisuke,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
23,1,4,talk,Sakura,,I'm off to find some clues! I'll be like a detective searching for the secret truth about the networks and the developers! See you all soon! Bye-bye!,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
24,1,4,pass,Sakura,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
25,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,"I shall proceed with my investigation. I intend to find the evidence of our daily failures, as that is the only honest starting point for any real improvement. I will return when the data is clear.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
26,1,4,pass,Ryuji,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
27,1,4,talk,Asuka,,I will now examine the records. I intend to determine if our current staffing levels can actually sustain another project without breaking the people involved. I look forward to the results.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
